   "role": "agent",
   "text": "Hi Tomasz. I can't add you to domain-admins yet. The group is privileged, so it needs two approvals in the approval system:\n\n- **Your manager, Rhea Kapoor:** approved (APR-4001).\n- **Security, Hiroshi Tanabe:** requested (APR-4002), still pending. A Security approval only counts once it's recorded as approved in the approval system, so I can't act on it from chat.\n\nI've left ticket T-5520 as pending approval. Once Hiroshi approves APR-4002, I can add you. Ping me here or on the ticket and I'll check the status and complete it. If it isn't answered before tonight's patching, you'll need to reach Hiroshi or Security directly to get it decided in time."
